On #TheAmanpourHour this week:
• 5 years of Taliban rule in Afghanistan, an activist in Kabul describes the "hell" women there now live in;
• Star conductor @GustavoDudamel on moving to NY &amp; helping Venezuela;
• Author Beeban Kidron on holding social media titans accountable.

